#: src/Activity.php:89
msgid ""
"Hello {nom},\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for applying to become a partner engineer of {site}. The platform team checks your diploma and your documents, usually within 3 working days, and tells you the decision by e-mail.\n"
"\n"
"Once approved, you appear on the list of partner engineers (without your contact details) and the platform offers you missions matching your specialties: {specialites}.\n"
"\n"
"Follow your application:\n"
"{lien}\n"
"\n"
"The {site} team"
